# Frontend environment configuration (Vite).
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) for machine-specific overrides,
# or set the variable in your CI/build environment. Vite exposes ONLY variables
# prefixed with `VITE_` to the client bundle.

# Base URL of the deployed backend API (API Gateway HTTPS endpoint).
#
# Requirements 6.1 / 6.3:
#   - This is the ONLY thing that couples the frontend build to a given
#     backend deployment — the two components deploy independently.
#   - The value MUST use the https:// scheme. A non-HTTPS value is rejected
#     at construction time (see src/api/client.ts `toHttpsBaseUrl`).
#   - In a PRODUCTION build this variable is REQUIRED; if it is missing the
#     build/app fails fast instead of falling back to a localhost/HTTP default.
#
# Use a placeholder here — do NOT commit a real deployed URL.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api-id.execute-api.your-region.amazonaws.com
